ce guru because she helps patients navigate their (often complicated) dental insurance policies and isn’t afraid to take her questions straight to the source."}],["$","p","When she’s not managing the business fin",{"className":"text-pretty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:leading-8","children":"When she’s not managing the business finances, you can find her shopping with her daughter, Briana or relishing old episodes of the Golden Girls. She lives in Wyoming with her husband Jim and likes to dabble in interior design on her days off."}]]}]]}]]}]}]
