retty text-[15.5px] leading-7 text-ink-soft sm:leading-8","children":"Heather and is a mama to three young kids, Ethan, Olivia and Cooper. She juggles work life and family life with grace, enjoys baking in her limited spare time and cruises around with husband Devon in their 1965 New Yorker on weekends. One day she’d like to rent an RV and take the whole family across the country."}]]}]]}]]}]}]
